---
---

<section class="py-24 bg-[#0f172a]/30 border-y border-white/5 relative z-10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">The Token Bill, Side by Side</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400">Same question. Same correct answer. Radically different cost.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <!-- WITHOUT Nocturnus -->
      <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-[#020617] border border-red-500/20 shadow-2xl flex flex-col">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-red-500/5 border-b border-red-500/10">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-red-400">Without NocturnusAI</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-red-400/60">150K tokens billed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto flex-1">
<pre><code><span class="text-slate-500">// Agent dumps entire KB into system prompt</span>
<span class="text-slate-500">// 500 facts, 47 rules, 12 scopes = 150K tokens</span>

<span class="text-slate-400">"Based on the conversation, I <span class="text-red-400">believe</span></span>
<span class="text-slate-400"> the customer is on the <span class="text-red-400">premium</span> plan.</span>
<span class="text-slate-400"> <span class="text-red-400">I'm not entirely sure</span>, but they</span>
<span class="text-slate-400"> mentioned something about enterprise</span>
<span class="text-slate-400"> features in a previous message..."</span>

<span class="text-red-400">// Wrong. The customer is on "starter".</span>
<span class="text-red-400">// Cost: $2.25 for a wrong answer.</span>
<span class="text-red-400">// Your agent just offered a discount</span>
<span class="text-red-400">// to the wrong tier. 💸</span></code></pre>
          </div>
      </div>

      <!-- WITH Nocturnus -->
      <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-[#020617] border border-emerald-500/20 shadow-2xl flex flex-col relative group">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-500/5 to-purple-500/5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-emerald-500/5 border-b border-emerald-500/10">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">With NocturnusAI</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400/60">820 tokens billed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto flex-1">
<pre><code><span class="text-slate-500">// Context engine selects 15 relevant facts</span>
<span class="text-slate-500">// Goal-driven: only what answers the question</span>

<span class="text-blue-400">POST</span> <span class="text-slate-300">/context/optimize</span>
&#123; <span class="text-purple-400">"goals"</span>: [&#123;<span class="text-green-400">"predicate"</span>: <span class="text-green-400">"subscription_tier"</span>,
              <span class="text-green-400">"args"</span>: [<span class="text-green-400">"acme_corp"</span>, <span class="text-green-400">"?tier"</span>]&#125;] &#125;

<span class="text-emerald-400">// ✓ 820 tokens · $0.01 · correct answer</span>
&#123; <span class="text-purple-400">"answer"</span>: <span class="text-green-400">"Acme Corp is on the starter plan."</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"derivation"</span>: [<span class="text-green-400">"subscription_tier(acme_corp, starter)"</span>],
  <span class="text-purple-400">"confidence"</span>: <span class="text-blue-400">0.95</span> &#125;

<span class="text-emerald-400">// Correct. Sourced. Provable. 225x cheaper. ✓</span></code></pre>
          </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Cost comparison strip -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-10">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-center">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-red-500/5 border border-red-500/10">
          <div class="text-lg font-black text-red-400">$2.25</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1">per request, unoptimized</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/3 border border-white/8 flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="text-2xl text-slate-600">→</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/5 border border-emerald-500/10">
          <div class="text-lg font-black text-emerald-400">$0.01</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1">per request, with NocturnusAI</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
